<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais warrants on French banking basket.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais warrants on French banking basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Finance (Guernsey) has issued three million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on a French banking basket comprising six share of Suez, four shares of Paribas, six shares of Credit Commercial de France and three shares of Credit Local de France, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 04.NOV.96-15.OCT.98   PAYDATE	31.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE			 ISS PRICE</p>
<p> CALL A	   90.0 PCT OF REF PRICE   1.91 PCT OF REF PRICE</p>
<p> CALL B	  100.0 PCT OF REF PRICE   1.35 PCT OF REF PRICE</p>
<p> CALL C	  110.0 PCT OF REF PRICE   0.95 PCT OF REF PRICE</p>
<p> REF PRICE     AVERAGE PRICE OF THE BASKET</p>
<p> --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
